NOTE ON MODELS AND DATA

This licence covers the source code only. The trained cry detector in
android/app/src/main/assets is derived in part from ESC-50 and UrbanSound8K,
both CC BY-NC 3.0, and therefore carries a NON-COMMERCIAL restriction that this
licence does not lift. Optional models downloaded at runtime carry their own
terms, including the Apple ML Research Model License for FastVLM. See the
"Third-party components and data" section of README.md.
